Give the scripts sfall's exec_map_update_scripts, get_current_inven_size and intface_hide/show/is_hidden

Inventory Filter counts a container's room with get_current_inven_size, FO2tweaks' light level reruns the map's scripts, and sfall's own gl_sfall-mods hides and shows the interface bar. Each called a metarule the engine did not have, which gave 0 and did nothing.
